    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 53；''重伤'' 26</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 15，''反射'' 17，''意志'' 15</span><span>''侦查'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 恐惧（当位于盟友两格以内时）</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">血狂</div>\n<div class=description>血魔龙兽可以在任何邻接的重伤敌人进行快步时对该敌人进行借机攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">嗜血</div>\n<div class=description>血魔龙兽对重伤目标的伤害骰获得+3 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+11 vs. AC<br>命中：1d10+4 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 13（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 19（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 10（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-2）</span><span>''魅力'' 13（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
